{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51646","headline":"戢兵山（旧名石鼓山，在黟县北十五里，高百仞，周十里，有石鼓、石人、石驴。相传石鼓鸣即驴鸣，人哭而长官不利。後凿其鼓破之，遂不复鸣。唐天宝六年改今名。） · 许坚","name":"戢兵山（旧名石鼓山，在黟县北十五里，高百仞，周十里，有石鼓、石人、石驴。相传石鼓鸣即驴鸣，人哭而长官不利。後凿其鼓破之，遂不复鸣。唐天宝六年改今名。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石鼓高悬藴大音，白云峯顶始铺金。\n能来斯地鼓斯鼓，尽达曹溪圣祖心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}